# RTU MTT manuals

The SATEL manuals live only in `docs/vendor/rtu-mtt/` on the developer machine. That directory is gitignored and dockerignored. Do not commit the PDFs, the extracted text, `INDEX.md`, or long quotations. The GitHub repository is public.

Product documents in that folder are RTU MTT 2.2.0. The API handbook is RTU MTT 2.0 (2017). Read `docs/vendor/rtu-mtt/INDEX.md` and `api-2.0.txt` before any RTU API design. Do not invent methods, tables, or URLs.

The handbook describes SOAP only. Prefer WSDL v2 at `https://<host>/service/?wsdl_v2`. WSDL v1 is obsolete there. Object names for a 2.2 switch come from that live WSDL, not from the 2.0 handbook alone.

CDR files still use the SSH allowlist and file intake. SOAP is not an SSH action. The Settings access check reads `getObjects` once. «Текущие звонки» may also `describeTable` and `selectRowset` on the two transit-call tables, summary pages or the shared module templates. When «Состояние вызова» has `have_lookup`, that page may `getLookup` for that column only. `groups.sync` may `describeTable` and `selectRowset` on «Входящие группы» in «Оборудование», with no `node` header and no `getLookup`. `phones.sync` may `describeTable`, `selectRowset`, and one nil-filter `countRowset` on the page «Оборудование» in the folder «Оборудование», with no `node` header. `getLookup` is only for «Тип оборудования», «Протокол сигнализации», and «Входящие группы» when `have_lookup` is set. `getColumnLookup` is sent only when that operation is in the fetched WSDL v2. When neither operation is there, one `getLookup` uses the accepted `describeTable` style. A missing lookup fails the phone job. `countRowset` is sent only when the fetched WSDL v2 contains that operation with `p_table_hi` and `p_filter`. `regs.poll` may `describeTable` and `selectRowset` on «Регистрации (ПКомм)» and «Регистрации (ПУпр)». A summary page has no `node` header. When it is absent, the shared «Регистрации» template is read with `node` only for `signaling-<digits>` on ПКомм and `scripting-<digits>` on ПУпр, at most four of each, after «Активные модули». `getLookup` is only for «Состояние» on the ПКомм page when `have_lookup` is set. `getColumnLookup` is sent only when that operation is in the fetched WSDL v2. When neither operation is there, one `getLookup` uses the accepted `describeTable` style. A missing or unread lookup does not fail that job. An unrecognized state does. «Время окончания регистрации» is added to the same ПКомм `selectRowset` only when that title occurs once and the technical name is acceptable. It is not looked up, and its absence does not fail the read. Writes stay forbidden unless a separate task names the operation.
